MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the hill-type rhythm. Key points alternate peak/valley with cosine interpolation.
mode 0 'peaks' (default): peaks at ~one level (peakY +- peakJitter), each valley its own depth
(depth +- depthJitter), occasional deep (deepChance x deepMul) or wide (wideChance x wideMul) valley,
symmetric bowls, depth growing along the island. mode 1 'zigzag': haqu random walk (minDY/rangeDY,
clamped). Fixed RNG draws per hill. Tune sliders updated. npm run sim/feel PASS in both modes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Nkzi78RYC1zWtLhT73ngE
